d073a87eb68bcac7734167cd41b":1},"m":205},{"id":"3drive_p9_206","t":"hey\n\nand this is the result maybe we can call it 4Drive!! but i think the concept is the same and it worked well at the zone","a":"omidfxt","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#206","p":9,"im":["22e365b1a76ce3cffc5396d534a8fb206260062e"],"fa":"سلام\n\nو این هم نتیجه؛ شاید بشود اسمش را 4Drive گذاشت!! ولی فکر می‌کنم مفهوم همان است و روی ناحیه خوب جواب داد","ib":{"22e365b1a76ce3cffc5396d534a8fb206260062e":2},"m":206},{"id":"3drive_p9_207","t":"HI RTM i am here now here is my first attempt in 3D","a":"salivan","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#207","p":9,"im":["0092b744967b9793229db739a6780e4e2ec65dbb"],"fa":"سلام RTM، حالا من هم اینجام؛ این اولین تلاشم در 3D است","ib":{"0092b744967b9793229db739a6780e4e2ec65dbb":1},"m":207},{"id":"3drive_p9_208","t":"2.","a":"salivan","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#208","p":9,"im":["0890cb0621eb1360ffdfb34c6c6d5e11dbcd8367"],"ib":{"0890cb0621eb1360ffdfb34c6c6d5e11dbcd8367":1},"m":208},{"id":"3drive_p9_209","t":"3.","a":"salivan","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#209","p":9,"im":["177d07c6db6a95a6e175f8f201aff1edac180349"],"ib":{"177d07c6db6a95a6e175f8f201aff1edac180349":1},"m":209},{"id":"3drive_p9_210","t":"4. this one is combine of 3 DRIVE with other concepts of RTM","a":"salivan","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#210","p":9,"im":["d7b0a168a45f6bb80effbaab0d0b265e13ca9511"],"fa":"4. این یکی ترکیبی از 3 DRIVE با مفاهیم دیگر RTM است","ib":{"d7b0a168a45f6bb80effbaab0d0b265e13ca9511":1},"m":210},{"id":"3drive_p9_211","t":"5.","a":"salivan","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#211","p":9,"im":["f04134fb70a7c695ce2a71c2d3a91a9c6bae9106"],"ib":{"f04134fb70a7c695ce2a71c2d3a91a9c6bae9106":1},"m":211},{"id":"3drive_p9_212","t":"here is my first 3Drive HW comments are welcome\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#212","p":9,"im":["b710ce80d52fbb3f62a1e8b77bca4d2b8bae3c27"],"fa":"این اولین تکلیف 3Drive من است؛ نظرات را با کمال میل می‌پذیرم\n\nGUNNER","ib":{"b710ce80d52fbb3f62a1e8b77bca4d2b8bae3c27":1},"m":212},{"id":"3drive_p9_213","t":"Fairly recent 3D on the CADCHF D1. Must say this pattern is hard to find with perfect symmetry.","a":"Fxnewbie","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#213","p":9,"im":["5b287823743ce7791d0c09d9516a267d468cc355"],"fa":"یک 3D نسبتاً تازه روی CADCHF در D1. باید بگویم پیدا کردن این الگو با تقارن کامل سخت است.","ib":{"5b287823743ce7791d0c09d9516a267d468cc355":1},"m":213},{"id":"3drive_p9_214","t":"After completing my compression homework, the next in line for me (and to complete the approach section in Marketpedia) is the 3Drive. I found this example on the Dollar Index Weekly Chart. 3Drives into supply. Notes are on the chart...\n\nIf we take a look at the PA on the daily chart for the 3Drive from the weekly chart above, it is possible to see more examples of potential 3Drives...\n\nI wish I had the data to take this example down to lower time frames, as it looks like there is a lot of interesting PA in here!\n\nperhaps, 3Drives within a 3Drive, within a 3Drive... like, 3Drive inception?","a":"moogroo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#214","p":9,"im":["09d94b4eef3c084ff50bf7f7181def884d2c483c","9dde0950f95984671fa6b364ac14af764e247b18"],"fa":"بعد از تمام کردن تکلیف فشردگی، نوبتِ من (و برای کامل کردن بخش approach در Marketpedia) به 3Drives رسیده. این نمونه را روی چارت هفتگی شاخص دلار پیدا کردم. 3Drive به سمت عرضه. یادداشت‌ها روی چارت است…\n\nاگر نگاهی به PA روی چارت روزانه بیندازیم، برای همان 3Drive چارت هفتگی بالا، می‌شود نمونه‌های بیشتری از 3Drive‌های بالقوه دید…\n\nای کاش داده‌اش را داشتم تا این نمونه را تا تایم‌چارچوب‌های پایین‌تر ببرم؛ چون به نظر می‌رسد PA بسیار جالبی اینجا هست!\n\nشاید inceptionِ 3Drive‌ها…؟","ib":{"09d94b4eef3c084ff50bf7f7181def884d2c483c":1,"9dde0950f95984671fa6b364ac14af764e247b18":2},"m":214},{"id":"3drive_p9_215","t":"Another 3Drive example I found while in forex tester today from 10th oct 2012, AUDUSD. A 3Drive on approach to a 1H FTR / fresh supply seen on the 15min chart...","a":"moogroo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#215","p":9,"im":["164b70b06e1578d41ec1a4004a8da45bfd078b59"],"fa":"یک نمونهٔ دیگر از 3Drive که امروز در Forex Tester پیدا کردم، از oct 2012، AUDUSD. یک 3Drive در نزدیک شدن به یک FTR ساعتی / عرضهٔ تازه که روی چارت 15 دقیقه دیده می‌شود… 15min","ib":{"164b70b06e1578d41ec1a4004a8da45bfd078b59":1},"m":215},{"id":"3drive_p9_216","t":"Homework Continues...looking at AUDUSD again starting with a drive up to supply the monthly chart that caught my eye, so naturally I wanted to dive in and investigate!","a":"moogroo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#216","p":9,"im":["71f2b6f2d7667c25cb7d4cc6a94d3fb05b726eef","942f7451a9ccb68cd25a653c0317b7e22bf96ec0","7b8acca03fb3ff7d3e0ca544b5fcc7ef28bed66c"],"fa":"تکلیف ادامه دارد… دوباره AUDUSD؛ شروع از یک حرکت صعودی به سمت عرضه در چارت ماهانه که چشمم را گرفت، پس طبیعتاً خواستم بریم داخلش و بررسی‌اش کنم!","ib":{"71f2b6f2d7667c25cb7d4cc6a94d3fb05b726eef":1,"942f7451a9ccb68cd25a653c0317b7e22bf96ec0":1,"7b8acca03fb3ff7d3e0ca544b5fcc7ef28bed66c":1},"m":216},{"id":"3drive_p9_217","t":"Next one! I spotted an approach to a weekly supply area, again on AUDUSD\n\nZooming into the daily chart, we see that the approach was a 3Drive. Where price reacted to through, was not all that clear, with how compressed price looked in the supply area.\n\nBut going into the 1H chart to have a look showed the fresh decision point, where fresh orders clearly existed.\n\nBack to the 3Drive in question, this is the 4H chart...This reveals another 3 drive through the FL..\n\nAnd even in the approach to the RBD of peak [1] and [3] from the daily chart, shows 3Drives on approach in the 1H chart for each of these,\n\nI enjoyed studying and marking this one up today... I think my eyes are becoming more attuned to them and I hope I'm on the right track with these!","a":"moogroo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#217","p":9,"im":["d2086097ac5405f4ded3f1d3dd9f27c10d951f45","9d5a5ded7652fa37b1c9c860e074e67234b1fbea","99f4522aa67039d060ab77f87471c559eac8f1df","a02ea9131cda58693aad6b26959645b12917f4f3","b9e263cd8cdb5a4bd82b724fdb27b46c4a80636f","9a6da0929f4137b84bf330d9910cb421ba84f243"],"fa":"بعدی! یک نزدیک‌شدن به ناحیهٔ عرضهٔ هفتگی دیدم، باز هم روی AUDUSD\n\nبا زوم روی چارت روزانه می‌بینیم که آن نزدیک‌شدن یک 3Drives بوده. اینکه قیمت به چه چیزی واکنش داد چندان روشن نبود، با توجه به اینکه قیمت در ناحیهٔ عرضه چقدر فشرده به نظر می‌رسید.\n\nاما رفتن به چارت 1H و نگاه کردن نشان داد نقطهٔ تصمیم تازه آنجاست، جایی که سفارش‌های تازه واضح وجود داشتند.\n\nبرگردیم به 3Drive مورد بحث، این چارت 4H است… این یکی 3Drive دیگری را از داخل FL نشان می‌دهد…\n\nو حتی در نزدیک‌شدن به RBD قله‌های 1 و 3 از چارت روزانه، برای هر کدام از این‌ها در چارت 1H باز 3Drive دیده می‌شود،\n\nامروز از مطالعه و علامت‌گذاری این یکی لذت بردم… فکر می‌کنم چشمم دارد به آن‌ها عادت می‌کند و امیدوارم در مسیر درست باشم!","ib":{"d2086097ac5405f4ded3f1d3dd9f27c10d951f45":1,"9d5a5ded7652fa37b1c9c860e074e67234b1fbea":2,"99f4522aa67039d060ab77f87471c559eac8f1df":3,"a02ea9131cda58693aad6b26959645b12917f4f3":4,"b9e263cd8cdb5a4bd82b724fdb27b46c4a80636f":5,"9a6da0929f4137b84bf330d9910cb421ba84f243":5},"m":217},{"id":"3drive_p9_218","t":"Continuing with the 3Drive homework... I'm trying to look at the overall picture while doing these homeworks, I feel like each homework topic should build on the previous...\n\nThis one is investigating an approach seen on the UJ monthly chart...\n\nThis is the past leading up to the approach shown on the weekly chart...\n\nThe approach shown here on the daily chart...\n\nAnd the reaction...","a":"moogroo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#218","p":9,"im":["9eb254465e0b2db833485135c0a4a4e78a372f51","88d54a4500cc8fc7be4494549379bc5c656396e9","be8c366e3f2da1dacfbf32296098d2d1e8483324","c1bf837bc30577eb24e7000ecffc373102660bb9"],"fa":"ادامهٔ تکلیف 3Drive… سعی می‌کنم موقع انجام این تکالیف تصویر کلی را ببینم؛ حس می‌کنم هر موضوع تکلیف باید روی قبلی ساخته شود…\n\nاین یکی بررسی یک نزدیک‌شدن است که در چارت ماهانهٔ UJ دیده می‌شود…\n\nاین هم گذشته تا رسیدن به آن نزدیک‌شدنی